first-use usability, actionable reports and comparable repeat runs are directions rather than shipped-feature claims. The next confirmed candidate is installation destination-parent access preflight; no fix is claimed here.\n\nStacked on open, unmerged PR #16 and its transitive #15/#14/#13/#12/#11/#9 chain. No merge, tag or release.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** locally prepared packages and historical sign-in-pending documentation.\n  **After:** retained authenticated Creator Studio evidence records all five named skills as Free / Pending Review and zero Live on 2026-10-18. Raw account/UI receipts stay local; public digests are in `docs/verification/TICKET-008/agensi-submission.json`. Pending review does not establish security approval, delivery compatibility or public availability.\n- Five ZIPs are unchanged against their reviewed manifest and actual submission receipt. Existing artifact proof includes five validators, eight primary local workflows, independent repeat workflows and a separate custom-input Codex evaluation. These use fictional fixtures and the explicitly equivalent core package; they are not fresh product outcomes.\n- Native goal creation/readback is active and matches `docs/iterative-goal.md` after native whitespace trimming. Saved heartbeat `geo-agensi` is ACTIVE, six-hourly, same-chat and points to that goal. Separate Standards and Spec snapshot/compact-objective/operational reviews have no actionable findings.\n- REA retained static inventory evidence for the actual orchestrator ZIP with its exact hash and central-directory limitations. This does not execute the package or verify Agensi.\n- Current head `20e15a80e4db98b37b7781d447cfcabbbe7506c4`: Code Review inspected verify job [117648145352](https://github.com/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/actions/runs/39118178866/job/117648145352), completed successfully: typecheck, 121 tests (121 pass, zero fail/skip), build. Full untruncated 34,538-character log retained locally under `reports/candidates/TICKET-015/ci-final.raw.json`. Source and ZIPs are unchanged by this setup; no new local full-suite run or rebuilt package is claimed.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way\n\nRepository package/documentation changes are reversible. External submissions and the app heartbeat have their own retained state and are managed separately.\n\n**Blast Radius:** distribution\n\nNo core source, dependency or CI implementation changed in the continuing-goal setup. No paid packs, payout/KYC/bank setup, sender contact, production edits, automatic merge or release.","created_at":"2026-10-17T15:26:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T10:10:57Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"0b48a687899ea6187b979029025a97a71b834c59","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pulls/17/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pulls/17/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/issues/17/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/statuses/20e15a80e4db98b37b7781d447cfcabbbe7506c4","head":{"label":"tsm0420:codex/agensi-skill-packages","ref":"codex/agensi-skill-packages","sha":"20e15a80e4db98b37b7781d447cfcabbbe7506c4","user":{"login":"tsm0420","id":62269874,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjY5ODc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62269874?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420","html_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/starred{/owner}{/repo}","su